---
layout: base.njk
title: Categories
description: 주제별로 글을 찾아보세요.
permalink: /categories/
---
<section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">카테고리</p><h1>분야별 기록<span>.</span></h1><p>{{ description }}</p></section>
<ol class="topic-directory">{% for category in topics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}<li><a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/"><span class="topic-index">0{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="topic-name"><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><small>{{ category.description }}</small></span><span class="topic-count">{{ categoryPosts | length }}개의 기록</span><span class="topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ol>
